OL,3,AWoman detained in Egypt over 'sister's
OL,4,Aactivism'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree of el-Shazly's other siblings
OL,7,Fhave also been detained, with her two
OL,8,Fbrothers already being held when she
OL,9,Fwas taken, and one of her sisters
OL,10,Fdetained soon after.
OL,12,FThe BBC has contacted the Egyptian
OL,13,Fconsulate in London but has not had a
OL,14,Fresponse.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
